cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HMAGLOFDB review: cleaned data, quality report and version diff"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite both it and the underlying ICIMOD dataset."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghimire"
    given-names: "Prajwal"
repository-code: "https://github.com/prazg/GLOF_dashboard"
url: "https://prazg.github.io/GLOF_dashboard/"
abstract: >-
  A cleaned, analysis-ready copy of HMAGLOFDB v4.0 (ICIMOD's inventory of glacial lake
  outburst floods in High Mountain Asia), a 17-point data quality report, and a diff
  across the v1.0 to v4.0 releases, presented as a self-contained interactive dashboard.
keywords:
  - GLOF
  - glacial lake outburst flood
  - High Mountain Asia
  - Himalaya
  - cryosphere
  - data quality
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/prazg/GLOF_dashboard/blob/main/LICENSE-DATA.md"
references:
  - type: data
    title: "GLOF database of High Mountain Asia"
    authors:
      - name: "International Centre for Integrated Mountain Development (ICIMOD)"
    year: 2025
    doi: "10.26066/RDS.1973283"
    license: CC-BY-4.0
